WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Namaste, this is Pradeep Bhattacharjee.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:13.000
In the year 1980, almost 40 years from today, I took a job at Bokaro Steel Plant.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:24.000
At that time, around 70-80 young engineers, mostly of the same age and background as mine, joined Bokaro Steel Plant with me.

4
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Since then, Bokaro Steel Plant has come a long way and our lifestyles have also changed significantly with it.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Many years of working together with my peers have resulted in creating a very congenial atmosphere here

6
00:00:39.001 --> 00:00:43.001
All these years we have spent our time together like a big family 

7
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Now that I have retired, I have decided to go back to my native town where I have my extended family and my own house.

8
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.000
I do feel sad to leave this city but we all have to adjust to the changing times.

9
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.000
This is the reality of life.

10
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Hence, the time has come for me to leave Bokaro now.

11
00:01:14.001 --> 00:01:14.501
Thank You
